posts.text:
@mayor.nyc.gov started cracking down on delivery apps’ shady tipping practices in January.

That policy has now delivered about $104 MILLION in additional tips to deliveristas.

These workers have been fighting Big Tech’s greed for years. Kudos to them and Mayor Mamdani for putting workers first.

